a-hidden=\"true\"><i data-lucide=\"send\"></i></span><span>Sent</span></a\n          >\n          <a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Staging\"\n            ><span class=\"sidebar-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i data-lucide=\"flame\"></i></span><span>Staging</span\n            ><span class=\"sidebar-dot\" data-variant=\"destructive\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Failing\"></span\n          ></a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Density","html":"<!-- columns are STACKED (full-width rows): the component auto-collapses a rail\n     whose row drops below 384px - three side-by-side flex-1 columns inside a\n     592px card would each sit under that threshold and dock to the icon rail,\n     hiding the entry text (the \"text not visible\" regression). -->\n<div class=\"stack gap-4\">\n  <div>\n    <p class=\"demo-label\">Compact</p>\n    <aside\n      class=\"app-sidebar\"\n      data-density=\"compact\"\n      style=\"\n        position: relative;\n        width: auto;\n        height: 11rem;\n        border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      \"\n      ><div class=\"sidebar-header\"><span class=\"sidebar-logo-text\">App</span></div\n      ><div class=\"sidebar-content\"\n        ><nav class=\"sidebar-nav\"\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Dashboard</span></a\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Inbox</span></a\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Settings</span></a></nav\n        ></div\n      ></aside\n    >\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <p class=\"demo-label\">Comfortable</p>\n    <aside\n      class=\"app-sidebar\"\n      data-density=\"comfortable\"\n      style=\"\n        position: relative;\n        width: auto;\n        height: 11rem;\n        border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      \"\n      ><div class=\"sidebar-header\"><span class=\"sidebar-logo-text\">App</span></div\n      ><div class=\"sidebar-content\"\n        ><nav class=\"sidebar-nav\"\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Dashboard</span></a\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Inbox</span></a\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Settings</span></a></nav\n        ></div\n      ></aside\n    >\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <p class=\"demo-label\">Spacious</p>\n    <aside\n      class=\"app-sidebar\"\n      data-density=\"spacious\"\n      style=\"\n        position: relative;\n        width: auto;\n        height: 11rem;\n        border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      \"\n      ><div class=\"sidebar-header\"><span class=\"sidebar-logo-text\">App</span></div\n      ><div class=\"sidebar-content\"\n        ><nav class=\"sidebar-nav\"\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Dashboard</span></a\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Inbox</span></a\n          ><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"#\"><span>Settings</span></a></nav\n        ></div\n      ></aside\n    >\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":false}]
